SOLUTION 1
    temp 100
    pH 5
    pe 4
    C 0.5 mmol/kgw
    Mn 1 mmol/kgw
    units mmol/kgw

RATES
    Calcite
    -start
    10 k = 0.001
    20 sa = 10.0
    30 rate = k * sa * (1 - SR("Calcite"))
    40 save rate * TIME
    -end

KINETICS 1
    Calcite
    -m 1.0
    -m0 1.0
    -steps 1000 in 100 steps

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file final_check.txt
    -reset false
    -step
    -pe
    -pH

END
